基于知识图谱的医疗诊断问答系统设计与实现

摘要：伴近年来，随着互联网技术迭代升级、公众医疗认知与健康需求持续攀升，便捷高效的精准医疗咨询已成为健康管理领域的核心诉求。传统医疗服务存在优质资源分布失衡、就医流程繁琐、问诊效率低等突出痛点，对此设计实现了一套基于知识图谱的医疗诊断问答系统，为普通用户与基层医疗工作者提供轻量,智能化的医疗咨询辅助服务。
(1) 结合行业现状与临床需求，基于 Neo4j 图数据库搭建医疗知识图谱和引入 GraphRAG 技术，以知识图谱为唯一可信数据源，解决大语言模型 “幻觉回答” 问题，保障回答精准可溯源，整合多维度医疗实体，通过人工校验与算法优化构建精准实体关联，规避单一算法的图谱构建缺陷。
(2) 完成前后端分离架构开发，后端基于 FastAPI 构建 API 服务，前端基于 Vue 3 实现流式交互界面；结合大语言模型与 Function Calling 技术搭建智能体模块，实现适配用户需求的智能检索与推理。
系统实现了症状初诊、疾病查询、用药推荐、语义检索等核心功能，支持多轮对话上下文记忆，配套用户认证、对话归档导出等辅助功能。经多轮测试，系统可精准识别用户咨询诉求，输出符合临床规范的诊疗建议，无明显专业偏差；平均响应时间低于 1.5 秒，交互流畅，达到设计预期。
本系统以医疗知识图谱为核心，既能为基层医疗工作者提供辅助诊断工具、提升诊疗效率与精准度，也能为普通用户提供便捷的健康咨询渠道，在基层医疗服务与居家健康管理场景中具备较高实用价值与广阔应用前景。
关键词：知识图谱；医疗问答；大语言模型；GraphRAG；智能诊断
Abstract: In recent years, with the iterative upgrading of Internet technology, the continuous improvement of public medical awareness and the growing demand for health care, convenient, efficient and precise medical consultation has become the core demand in the field of health management. Traditional medical services have prominent pain points such as unbalanced distribution of high-quality medical resources, cumbersome medical treatment processes, and low consultation efficiency. To address these issues, this paper designs and implements a medical diagnosis question-and-answer system based on knowledge graph, which provides lightweight and intelligent auxiliary medical consultation services for general users and primary medical workers.
(1) Combined with the industry status quo and clinical needs, the system builds a medical knowledge graph based on the Neo4j graph database and introduces GraphRAG technology. Taking the knowledge graph as the only credible data source, it solves the problem of "hallucination" of large language models, ensures the accuracy and traceability of responses, integrates multi-dimensional medical entities, constructs accurate entity associations through manual verification and algorithm optimization, and avoids the defects of graph construction with a single algorithm.
(2) The development of the front-end and back-end separated architecture is completed. The back-end builds API services based on FastAPI, and the front-end implements a streaming interactive interface based on Vue 3. Combined with large language models and Function Calling technology, an Agent module is built to realize intelligent retrieval and reasoning adapted to user needs.
The system has realized core functions such as preliminary symptom diagnosis, disease information query, drug recommendation, and semantic retrieval, supports context memory for multi-round dialogues, and is equipped with auxiliary functions including user authentication, dialogue history archiving and export. After multiple rounds of testing, the system can accurately identify the core demands of users in medical consultation, output diagnosis and treatment suggestions in line with clinical specifications without obvious professional deviations. The average response time of the system is less than 1.5 seconds, with smooth interaction, which fully meets the expected design goals.
With the medical knowledge graph as the core, the system can not only provide primary medical workers with an auxiliary diagnosis tool to improve the efficiency and accuracy of diagnosis and treatment, but also provide general users with a convenient and accessible health consultation channel. It has high practical value and broad application prospects in the scenarios of primary medical services and home-based health management.
Keywords: Knowledge Graph; Medical QA; Large Language Model; GraphRAG; Intelligent Diagnosis
 
